  "id": "baked-ziti-with-sausage",
  "name": "Baked Ziti with Sausage",
  "subtitle": "A hearty pasta casserole with tomato sauce and three cheeses.",
  "description": "Sausage, marinara, and ziti are layered with ricotta, mozzarella, and Pecorino Romano, then baked until bubbling and melted.",
